  2910	The last parameter of a recipe may be variadic, indicated with either a `+` or
  2911	a `*` before the argument name:
  2912	
  2913	```just
  2914	backup +FILES:
  2915	  scp {{FILES}} <email>:
  2916	```
  2917	
  2918	Variadic parameters prefixed with `+` accept _one or more_ arguments and expand
  2919	to a string containing those arguments separated by spaces:
  2920	
  2921	```console
  2922	$ just backup FAQ.md GRAMMAR.md
  2923	scp FAQ.md GRAMMAR.md <email>:
  2924	FAQ.md                  100% 1831     1.8KB/s   00:00
  2925	GRAMMAR.md              100% 1666     1.6KB/s   00:00
  2926	```
  2927	
  2928	Variadic parameters prefixed with `*` accept _zero or more_ arguments and
  2929	expand to a string containing those arguments separated by spaces, or an empty
  2930	string if no arguments are present:
  2931	
  2932	```just
  2933	commit MESSAGE *FLAGS:
  2934	  git commit {{FLAGS}} -m "{{MESSAGE}}"
  2935	```
  2936	
