  2977	Parameters may be constrained to match regular expression patterns using the
  2978	`[arg("name", pattern="pattern")]` attribute<sup>1.45.0</sup>:
  2979	
  2980	```just
  2981	[arg('n', pattern='\d+')]
  2982	double n:
  2983	  echo $(({{n}} * 2))
  2984	```
  2985	
  2986	A leading `^` and trailing `$` are added to the pattern, so it must match the
  2987	entire argument value.
  2988	
  2989	You may constrain the pattern to a number of alternatives using the `|`
  2990	operator:
  2991	
  2992	```just
  2993	[arg('flag', pattern='--help|--version')]
  2994	info flag:
  2995	  just {{flag}}
  2996	```
